  "description": "Funeral director Hyunwoo is assigned an unclaimed body that has nothing left but the three characters of the name “Im Sehyeon.”\n\nAs he lifts the cloth, just as he always does, to see the deceased off on their final journey, he catches his breath at Sehyeon’s face—strangely full of life and strikingly beautiful.\n\nPerhaps it was because that brief yet intense first meeting had been burned so deeply into his mind.\n\nFrom that night on, Sehyeon begins appearing at Hyunwoo’s home,\n\nreaching out with a dangerous, dizzying touch—\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/ghost_lover)",
